      "blurb": "The referral has been entered into our scheduling system and a team member will reach out to the patient today or the next business day. For your records, the patient ID is PRE1068839. Please use this",
      "body": "<div>The referral has been entered into our scheduling system and a team member will reach out to the patient today or the next business day.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div><br /></div><div><b style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 248);\" data-stringify-type=\"bold\">For your records, the patient ID is PRE1068839.&nbsp; Please use this for all future communications.</b></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div>We will also send them a text shortly letting them know to call us in case we miss them when we reach out.</div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><b>The patient is welcome to call our direct scheduling line M-F 8am to 5pm @ 818-629-1169</b></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div>Once we can schedule them and they complete their exam, reports are typically sent out within 24-72 hours.</div><div><br /></div><div></div><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Patients can also view their appointment times, answer\nprescreening questions and sign all liens here:</span></div><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://precise.radflow360.com/patient-portal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://precise.radflow360.com/patient-portal</a></span></u></div><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><b><u><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If this is also a personal injury case:</span></u></b></div><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\">\n <li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">A report containing&nbsp;the findings of the exam will\n     also be sent to the attorney</span></b></li>\n <li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">A bill will be sent to the attorney once both the\n     patient and the attorney sign all pending liens</span></b></li>\n <li style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Please make sure to submit a negotiation offer before\n     sending the payment</span></b></li>\n</ul><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://precise.radflow360.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Access\nbills, appointment times, and e-sign liens​&nbsp; (Click request login if you\ndon't have an account)<br />\n</a></span></b></div><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><b><a href=\"https://precise.radflow360.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><br /></a></b></div><div style=\"line-height: normal;\" class=\"fa-oq4s2r\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://pacs.radflow360.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Access\nreports &amp; images</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.precisemri.com/request\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">(Request login here for reports)</span></a></b></div><div><b><a href=\"https://www.precisemri.com/request\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></b></div><div><br /></div>",
      "text": "The referral has been entered into our scheduling system and a team member will reach out to the patient today or the next business day. \n\n\nFor your records, the patient ID is PRE1068839. Please use this for all future communications.\n\n\n\n\nWe will also send them a text shortly letting them know to call us in case we miss them when we reach out.\n\n\n\n\nThe patient is welcome to call our direct scheduling line M-F 8am to 5pm @ 818-629-1169\n\n\n\n\nOnce we can schedule them and they complete their exam, reports are typically sent out within 24-72 hours.\n\n\n\nPatients can also view their appointment times, answer\nprescreening questions and sign all liens here:\nhttps://precise.radflow360.com/patient-portal\n\nIf this is also a personal injury case:\n\n\nA report containing the findings of the exam will\nalso be sent to the attorney\n\nA bill will be sent to the attorney once both the\npatient and the attorney sign all pending liens\n\nPlease make sure to submit a negotiation offer before\nsending the payment\n\n\n\nAccess\nbills, appointment times, and e-sign liens​ (Click request login if you\ndon't have an account)\n\n\n\nAccess\nreports & images (Request login here for reports)",
